# Naming & Structure

## Folders

- `src/app/(group)/...` — Next.js App Router route groups
- `src/features/<domain>/` — `api/`, `components/`, `hooks/`, `schemas/`
- `src/components/` — shared UI (ui, layout, charts, feedback)
- `src/lib/` — api client, rbac, auth, utils
- `src/stores/` — client state (auth, ui, chat)
- `src/types/` — shared types
- `src/config/` — navigation, site config
- `src/constants/` — roles, enums

## Naming

- Components: `PascalCase.tsx`
- Hooks: `useThing.ts`
- API modules: `<domain>.api.ts`
- Schemas: `<domain>.schema.ts`
- Stores: `<name>-store.ts`
- Query keys: centralize in `lib/api/query-keys.ts`

## Features map to product domains

`auth`, `organization`, `ai-workspace`, `ai-providers`, `ai-gateway`, `usage`, `cost`, `roi`, `analytics`, `audit`, `notifications`, `business-context`, `system-config`
